{"MaqraNumber":107.0,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":1,"ShowSurahName":true,"ShowBismillah":true,"Text":"أَتَىٰٓ أَمۡرُ ٱللَّهِ فَلَا تَسۡتَعۡجِلُوهُۚ سُبۡحَٰنَهُۥ وَتَعَٰلَىٰ عَمَّا يُشۡرِكُونَ","TajweedText":"أَتَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ</tajweed> أَمْرُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ فَلَا تَسْتَعْجِلُوهُ‌ۚ سُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>حَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> وَتَعَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لَىٰ عَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا يُشْرِك<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١</span>","End":"١","PageNumber":267,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":224,"MaqraNumber":107,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":2,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يُنَزِّلُ ٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ بِٱلرُّوحِ مِنۡ أَمۡرِهِۦ عَلَىٰ مَن يَشَآءُ مِنۡ عِبَادِهِۦٓ أَنۡ أَنذِرُوٓاْ أَنَّهُۥ لَآ إِلَٰهَ إِلَّآ أَنَا۠ فَٱتَّقُونِ","TajweedText":"يُنَزِّلُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَلَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>ئِكَةَ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رُّوحِ مِنْ أَمْرِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> عَلَىٰ م<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>َش<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءُ مِنْ عِبَادِه<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِۦٓ</tajweed> أَنْ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نذ</tajweed>ِر<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> ل<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هَ إِلّ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَنَا۟ فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٢</span>","End":"٢","PageNumber":267,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilN