class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٨</span>","End":"٨","PageNumber":268,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":224,"MaqraNumber":107,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":9,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَعَلَى ٱللَّهِ قَصۡدُ ٱلسَّبِيلِ وَمِنۡهَا جَآئِرٞۚ وَلَوۡ شَآءَ لَهَدَىٰكُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","TajweedText":"وَعَلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ قَصْدُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّبِيلِ وَمِنْهَا ج<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓئِ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٌ‌ۚ و</tajweed>َلَوْ ش<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَ لَهَدَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ٮٰ</tajweed>كُمْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>مَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٩</span>","End":"٩","PageNumber":268,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":224,"MaqraNumber":107,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":10,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"هُوَ ٱلَّذِيٓ أَنزَلَ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءٗۖ لَّكُم مِّنۡهُ شَرَابٞ وَمِنۡهُ شَجَرٞ فِيهِ تُسِيمُونَ","TajweedText":"هُوَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نز</tajweed>َلَ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ م<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ءً‌ۖ ل</tajweed>َّك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنْهُ شَرَا<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>بٌ و</tajweed>َمِنْهُ شَجَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>رٌ ف</tajweed>ِيهِ تُسِيم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٠</span>","End":"١٠","PageNumber":268,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":225,"MaqraNumber":107,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":11,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يُنۢبِتُ لَكُم بِهِ ٱلزَّرۡعَ وَٱلزَّيۡتُونَ وَٱلنَّخِيلَ وَٱلۡأَعۡنَٰبَ وَمِن كُلِّ ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِۚ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَةٗ لِّقَوۡمٖ يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","TajweedText":"يُ<tajweed class=iqlab>نۢب</tajweed>ِتُ لَك<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِهِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>زَّرْعَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>زَّيْتُونَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َخِيلَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَعْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بَ وَمِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>ُلِّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ثَّمَر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>تِ‌ۗ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ فِى ذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَ لَأَيَ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ةً ل</tajweed>ِّقَوْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مٍ ي</tajweed>َتَفَكَّر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١١</span>","End":"١١","PageNumber":268,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":225,"MaqraNumber":107,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":12,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَسَخَّرَ لَكُمُ ٱلَّيۡلَ وَٱلنَّهَارَ وَٱلشَّمۡسَ وَٱلۡقَمَرَۖ وَٱلنُّجُومُ مُسَخَّرَٰتُۢ بِأَمۡرِهِۦٓۚ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَٰتٖ لِّقَوۡمٖ يَعۡقِلُونَ","TajweedText":"وَسَخَّرَ لَكُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّيْلَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهَارَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>شَّمْسَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْقَمَرَ‌ۖ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah